{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FocusFlip 是一款把手機翻面動作變成專注開關的計時工具，適合容易分心、想減少拿起手機次數的學生與上班族。把手機面朝下放桌上便自動開始計時，拿起即停止並以幽默訊息提醒；原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>翻面即啟動專注計時</h2>\n<p>手機面朝下即自動計時，拿起時停止並以搞笑訊息回應。內建 11 個等級，由「金魚腦」升級至「超人聖者」，可收集獎盃。鎖定畫面與動態島顯示即時計時，達標時通知；另備雨聲、海浪、營火等環境音，鎖定後仍可播放。可為閱讀、工作、考試建立設定檔與統計。無需帳號，資料留在裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-135-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-136-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-137-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-138-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-139-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-140-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FocusFlip: Flip to Focus</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T12:37:54.820391+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T12:19:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:58:08.636494+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"c9d558a5d5b278630d0fa171eef855e7905d43a4c11a0785faf56dbe70ddccd4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}